# A knowledge base kept in a file: `voegToe` puts a Bron, `graaf` gets the Graaf of its nodes back, each node one of
# the sum `type Node = Begrip | Bron`, made in one of two arms of a choice in `node`. The class is the library's door:
# its route starts at each public method a caller can call, its constructor among them. The methods run on the
# caller's instance, one value from beyond; what the constructor builds goes back to the caller.

route kennis.bank.Kennisbank
step Kennisbank()/Kennisbank()
step Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.voegToe
step Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.voegToe/Kennisbank.write
step Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf
step Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node              # in the arrow function handed to `map`
choice Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1
step Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1/Bron()
step Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1/Begrip()
step Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Graaf()

line entry > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank() call
line entry > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.voegToe call
line entry > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf call

# what the constructor builds goes back to the caller; the doors run on the caller's instance, one value from
# beyond, taken where a body reads its fields or calls on it
line Kennisbank()/Kennisbank() > Kennisbank@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank() value
known #74 line Kennisbank > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.voegToe/Kennisbank.write value
known #74 line Kennisbank > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf value
known #74 line Kennisbank > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node value
known #74 line Kennisbank > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Graaf() value   # `readFileSync(this.path, ..)` in what it is handed

# the put: the Bron a caller hands is written into the line `write` appends to what the file held
line Bron·bron > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.voegToe/Kennisbank.write value                    # what it is handed: `bron.uuid`, `bron.url` glue `bron` in
line Disk(Kennisbank.path) > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.voegToe/Kennisbank.write own
line Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.voegToe/Kennisbank.write > Disk(Kennisbank.path) own

# the get: the lines read, each a Bron or a Begrip, a Node in the Graaf given back
line Disk(Kennisbank.path) > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf own
line Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1/Bron() > Bron@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1 value
line Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1/Begrip() > Begrip@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1 value
line Bron@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1 > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node value
line Begrip@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1 > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node value
line Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node > Node@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node value
line Node@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Graaf() value
line Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Graaf() > Graaf@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Graaf() value
line Graaf@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Graaf() > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf value
line Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf > Graaf@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf value

home Kennisbank@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank() Kennisbank()
known #74 home Kennisbank Kennisbank()
home Bron·bron Kennisbank()
home Bron@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1 Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node
home Begrip@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1 Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node
home Node@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf
home Graaf@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Graaf() Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf
home Graaf@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf Kennisbank()

# the line split in three parts, each held by its name: the kind decides the choice, the uuid and the text build the node
step Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split
line Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split > _·uuid@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split value
line Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split > _·soort@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split value
line Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split > _·tekst@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split value
known #101 line _·soort@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node value
line _·uuid@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1/Bron() value
line _·tekst@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1/Bron() value
line _·uuid@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1/Begrip() value
line _·tekst@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1/Begrip() value
home _·uuid@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node
home _·soort@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node
home _·tekst@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node

side entry left
side Disk(Kennisbank.path) both

